      "quote": "Her main complaint was constipation. She had some upper GI symptoms that included nausea, early satiety, and mild reflux symptoms. In addition, she had pharyngeal dysphagia, an intermittent hold-up of food in the pharynx. The patient continued to have some degree of breakthrough nausea and vomiting approximately once or twice a week.",
